sheets.prompt:
Create a professional additive-blending videogame VFX sprite sheet ON A PERFECTLY SOLID PURE BLACK RGB(0,0,0) BACKGROUND. Absolutely no white/gray background, NO fog layer between cells, NO transparency, NO checkerboard. The empty black MUST occupy at least 65% of the whole sheet. The background will disappear with additive blending in the game.

EIGHT sequential animation cels, exactly 4 columns x 2 rows, widescreen 2:1 canvas, each cell square. Each cel has a large perfectly BLACK border at least 16% of cell size. All sword trails, wisps and sparks are fully contained in the center 68% of each square. No drawn grid, no letters.

Subject: a godlike weapon master's ultimate SWORD TEMPEST in premium Korean fantasy action RPG painted VFX style. Brilliant bright white wide jagged sword slash surfaces, electric cobalt blue energy and luminous gold filaments. Sharp, savage, intricate, intensely layered, violent acceleration and beautiful asymmetric tapered shapes. Use many actual sword-edge shapes and branching blade shards, NOT decorative abstract concentric circles. It must be much richer than a few clean arcs: hundreds of little gold sparks, lightning-like forked edges, dense streaked BLUE energy turbulence tightly bound to each cutting surface. NO broad white glow clouds. All glow stays tight to the cutting edges; color decays fully to black well before cell boundaries.

Sequential action:
1 compressed small blade cluster pointed right;
2 one forceful white-blue horizontal broad cutting wave exploding rightward;
3 two diagonal sword cuts cross through the horizontal wave with starburst contact;
4 peak six-direction crossing slashes with bright ivory center and blue-gold splinters;
5 furious upward spiral of broken curved cutting surfaces piercing the cross;
6 four wide splitting dagger-like cutting waves explode outward;
7 broken slashes disperse into sharp angular sparks, mass halves;
8 last sparse tiny gold sparks and blue slash fragments disappear.

EIGHT separate unique hand-painted drawings with coherent progression and same center. No characters, scenery, terrain, UI, logos, physical sword hilts, metal shields, decorative emblems. This is fast destructive blade ENERGY, not a stationary ornament.
